WEBVTT

00:01:31.902 --> 00:01:33.052
I'm numb.

00:01:34.839 --> 00:01:36.521
And I'm not surprised.

00:01:37.458 --> 00:01:40.577
I've traveled all across
the world giving talks,

00:01:40.601 --> 00:01:43.236
and like clockwork, after every event,

00:01:44.125 --> 00:01:45.796
more than one person approaches me

00:01:45.820 --> 00:01:47.887
so that they can
say their piece in private.

00:01:49.355 --> 00:01:51.443
And I always tried to reassure them.

00:01:53.403 --> 00:01:56.403
You know, I'd give them local resources

00:01:57.774 --> 00:02:01.755
and a soft reassurance
that they're not alone